jobs.description:
We are looking for a Logistics Reception & Expedition Employee for our logistics department. In this versatile role, you will be the first point of contact for drivers and ensure that incoming and outgoing goods flow smoothly and correctly.

- Receiving and registering drivers and visitors;
- Coordinating incoming and outgoing goods;
- Checking freight documents and transport documentation;
- Administrative processing in the logistics system;
- Managing loading and unloading processes;
- Assisting with loading and unloading;
- Ensuring order, cleanliness, and safety in the dispatch area.

- Experience in a logistics role;
- Experience with an EPT, forklift, or reach truck;
- Good communication skills;
- Accurate and stress-resistant work ethic;
- Basic knowledge of MS Office and logistics systems;
- You speak the English language.
